    "name": "Fivitel Boutique Da Nang",
    "detail": "i have stay in Fivitel Boutique Da Nang for3 Nights, and what i can tell is this hotel is very nice... don't judge the hotel by out look, when go in to the lobby and is refreshing with all the holidays atmosphere... i need to special highlight the intelligent front desk Miss IVY and the lovely hotel assist Mr PANDA, thanks a lot on their help while i stay in this beautiful hotel... i like the breakfast buffet, it have include a lot kind of street food and also some standard breakfast like bread and egg... for the room is big enough and the towel and bed sheet is clean, and if u have problem with sleep that cause by noise please request higher room cause in Vietnam we know the traffic is communicate by the horn... and the car rent offer from the hotel is worth to go far, if near better look in grab... so if have chance when to Da Nang, this hotel is 1 of the good choice. Thank you very much... ",
